{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-worked-examples-table9-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-worked-examples-table9-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 9 from tm-worked-examples","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-worked-examples"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-worked-examples-table9-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:tm-worked-examples-table9-data\"></a><p>This table records the single crossing at generator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_1</code> for the\ndaughter nucleus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^3\\mathrm{He}</code> in the tritium <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-decay worked\nexample. The nucleons at positions <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code> form a proton–neutron\npair, so the crossing is <em>mixed</em> and contributes the mixed transfer\nmatrix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{\\mathrm{mix}}(q)</code> — the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{p}</code>–<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{n}</code>\ncrossing matrix defined in the <a href=\"#sec:tm-worked-examples\">worked-examples\nderivation</a>. Hence\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">M_1^{\\mathrm{dau}} = T_{\\mathrm{mix}}</code>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Crossing</th>\n<th>Daughter type</th>\n<th>Matrix</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1, 2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{p}</code>-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{n}</code> = mix</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{\\mathrm{mix}}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-transfer-matrices/tm-worked-examples-table9-data.md","heading":"Table"}
